flowchart LR
 Base[Base Libraries] --> Resolve[Library Resolver]
 Override[Tenant Overrides] --> Resolve
 Vendor[Vendor Quotes / Custom Rates] --> Resolve
 Regional[Regional Profile / Location Factors] --> Resolve
 Resolve --> Snapshot[Immutable Library Snapshot]
 Snapshot --> Estimator[Phase 26 Estimator]
 Estimator --> NewSvc[New Service / Assembly Proposal]
 NewSvc --> Review[Human Review / Approval]
 AI[AI Proposed Writeback] --> Review
 Review --> Draft[Governed Draft / Version]
 Draft --> Publish[Approved Publish]
 Publish --> Resolve
